      By Proposition <a href="/tag/4F4564" data-tag="4F4564">4.1.2.1</a>, $i$ and $j \circ i$ are contravariant equivalences in $(\sSet )_{/C}$. It follows that $j$ is a trivial cofibration in $(\sSet )_{/C}$, so that $j$ is right anodyne (by Proposition <a href="/tag/4F4564" data-tag="4F4564">4.1.2.1</a> again). 
